Troubleshooting
Issue: Permission Denied on JSON Files
Solution:

chmod 600 *.json
Issue: Module Not Found Error
Solution:

python3 -m pip install --upgrade pip
All required modules (secrets, string, json) are built-in to Python 3.6+.

Issue: Tokens Appear Too Short
Explanation: Token length in bytes vs characters:

token_hex(32) produces 64 characters (2 hex chars per byte)
token_urlsafe(32) produces ~43 characters (base64 encoding)
Both provide 256 bits of entropy (secure).

Issue: Script Not Executable
Solution:

chmod +x *.py
